  m_Text: "The gas chamber is connected to a movable piston. This means its volume
    can change while the pressure remains constant.\r\n\r\nIn the initial state,
    the gas temperature is              and the volume is \t\n.\r\n\r\nYour goal
    is to heat the gas so that its temperature increases to the point where the volume
    grows to \n\r\n\n"
